          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'/>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'/>\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — About</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#0f1720;--card:#0b1220;--muted:#9aa6b2;--accent:#ffb86b;--white:#ffffff;--max:1100px}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;color:var(--white);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#07101a 0%, #0f1720 100%);}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:32px auto;padding:28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.7)}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#ff7b91);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;color:#102022}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a:hover{color:var(--white)}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;margin-top:28px;align-items:start}\\n    .eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.06em}\\n    h1{margin:10px 0 8px;font-size:32px;line-height:1.02}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px;max-width:60ch}\\n    .profile{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .avatar{width:100%;height:260px;border-radius:8px;background:#071321;display:grid;place-items:center}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--accent);color:#102022;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    section{margin-top:28px}\\n    .grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}\\n    .card{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:18px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .quote{font-style:italic;color:var(--accent);margin:10px 0}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding-top:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .small{font-size:12px;color:#a7b4be}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.avatar{height:180px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <header>\\n      <div class='brand'>\\n        <div class='logo'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style='font-weight:700'>{{THERAPIST_NAME}} <span class='small'>{{LICENSE}}</span></div>\\n          <div class='muted' style='font-size:13px'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n        <a href='specialties.html'>Work With Me</a>\\n        <a href='approach.html'>My Compass</a>\\n        <a href='fees.html'>Fees</a>\\n        <a href='book.html'>Book</a>\\n        <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <div class='hero'>\\n        <div>\\n          <div class='eyebrow'>Private Practice in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n          <h1>Thoughtful therapy for moments that matter</h1>\\n          <p class='lead'>I offer focused, ethically grounded therapy tailored to adults navigating anxiety, life transitions, relationship challenges, and the lasting effects of stress or trauma. My approach balances practical tools with reflective work so you can notice change and carry it into daily life.</p>\\n          <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n\\n          <section aria-labelledby='story-heading'>\\n            <h2 id='story-heading' style='margin-top:18px'>Why I do this work</h2>\\n            <p class='muted'>I trained in trauma-informed care and brief, evidence-informed therapies. Over years in community and private settings, I learned that people most benefit from a steady, compassionate guide who clarifies what matters and offers tools that fit their life. That balance — warmth plus structure — is central here.</p>\\n          </section>\\n\\n          <section aria-labelledby='framework-heading'>\\n            <h2 id='framework-heading' style='margin-top:18px'>How I structure therapy</h2>\\n            <div class='grid-3' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n              <div class='card'>\\n                <strong>Collaborative Goals</strong>\\n                <p class='muted'>We set clear, measurable goals together and revisit them so work stays relevant to your life.</p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class='card'>\\n                <strong>Practical Skills</strong>\\n                <p class='muted'>Tools for regulation, communication, and pacing between sessions so the work lands where it matters.</p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class='card'>\\n                <strong>Reflective Processing</strong>\\n                <p class='muted'>Space to make sense of patterns, values, and relationships in a way that supports sustainable change.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </section>\\n\\n          <section aria-labelledby='programs-heading'>\\n            <h2 id='programs-heading' style='margin-top:18px'>Paths I offer</h2>\\n            <p class='muted'>I tailor a path based on your goals. Examples below are common frameworks I use; we'll design what fits you.</p>\\n            <div class='grid-3' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n              <div class='card'>\\n                <strong>Reflect & Restore</strong>\\n                <p class='muted'>8–12 sessions focusing on anxiety regulation, distress tolerance, and sleep stabilization.</p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class='card'>\\n                <strong>Growth Partnership</strong>\\n                <p class='muted'>18-week series for relationship repair, communication skills, and boundary setting.</p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class='card'>\\n                <strong>Transition Support</strong>\\n                <p class='muted'>Short-term, solution-oriented plan to navigate career, family, or life-stage changes.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </section>\\n\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <aside class='profile'>\\n          <div class='avatar'>\\n            <!-- inline SVG avatar unique to this page -->\\n            <svg width='180' height='180' viewBox='0 0 180 180' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='avatar'>\\n              <rect width='180' height='180' rx='14' fill='#0b1320'/>\\n              <g transform='translate(16,16)' fill='none' stroke='url(#g)' stroke-width='3'>\\n                <defs>\\n                  <linearGradient id='g' x1='0' x2='1'>\\n                    <stop offset='0' stop-color='#ffb86b'/>\\n                    <stop offset='1' stop-color='#ff7b91'/>\\n                  </linearGradient>\\n                </defs>\\n                <circle cx='74' cy='44' r='28' stroke-linecap='round'/>\\n                <path d='M16 142c8-36 64-36 96 0' stroke-linejoin='round'/>\\n              </g>\\n            </svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style='margin-top:14px'>\\n            <div style='font-weight:700'>{{THERAPIST_NAME}}</div>\\n            <div class='muted'>{{LICENSE}} • {{MODALITIES}}</div>\\n            <p class='muted' style='margin-top:10px'>I offer telehealth and in-person sessions in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Sessions are private and confidential. I do not provide emergency services; see the note below for crisis resources.</p>\\n            <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='display:inline-block;margin-top:8px'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <section aria-labelledby='testimonials-heading'>\\n        <h2 id='testimonials-heading' style='margin-top:22px'>Words from people I've worked with</h2>\\n        <div class='card' style='margin-top:10px'>\\n          <div class='quote'>\\\"I learned concrete tools and also felt truly heard — practical and human.\\\"</div>\\n          <div class='muted small'>— Client in therapy for anxiety</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class='muted'>\\n        <strong>Confidentiality & scope:</strong> Conversations here are confidential within the limits of the law. I work with adults on anxiety, mood concerns, trauma processing, relationship patterns, and life transitions. I do not provide forensic or emergency services.\\n      </div>\\n      <div class='small' style='margin-top:8px'>If you are in crisis or danger, call local emergency services or your local crisis line. For US residents, dial 988 for the suicide & crisis lifeline.</div>\\n      <div style='margin-top:12px' class='muted'>Contact: <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:var(--white);text-decoration:none'>{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--white);text-decoration:none'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      <div style='margin-top:8px' class='muted'>Licensed: {{LICENSE}} • Modalities: {{MODALITIES}}</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"specialties.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'/>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'/>\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Specialties</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff;--ink:#071826;--accent:#2b6eff;--muted:#55687a;--card:#f5f9ff;--max:1100px}\\n    html,body{margin:0;height:100%;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}\\n    .container{max-width:var(--max);margin:36px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .nav a{margin-left:18px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    .hero{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;margin-top:18px}\\n    .hero-left{flex:1}\\n    .label{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}\\n    h1{font-size:36px;margin:6px 0}\\n    .intro{color:var(--muted);max-width:70ch}\\n    .svg-wrap{width:260px;height:180px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eaf2ff,transparent);border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .spec{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .spec h3{margin:4px 0}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted)}\\n    .price{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);margin-top:8px}\\n    .note{font-size:13px;color:#7f8c97;margin-top:10px}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;border-top:1px solid #e6eefb;padding-top:16px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{flex-direction:column}.svg-wrap{width:100%;height:140px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class='container'>\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class='muted' style='font-size:14px'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav class='nav'>\\n        <a href='index.html'>Start</a>\\n        <a href='about.html'>About</a>\\n        <a href='approach.html'>Approach</a>\\n        <a href='fees.html'>Costs</a>\\n        <a href='book.html'>Book</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <div class='hero'>\\n        <div class='hero-left'>\\n          <div class='label'>Areas of focus</div>\\n          <h1>Compassionate care for common, complex concerns</h1>\\n          <p class='intro'>I work with adults who are struggling with anxiety, relationship difficulties, past trauma, burnout, and life transitions. Below are clearer descriptions of how I typically help and what to expect in early sessions.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='svg-wrap' aria-hidden='true'>\\n          <!-- unique decorative pattern svg for specialties -->\\n          <svg width='220' height='140' viewBox='0 0 220 140' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'>\\n            <rect width='220' height='140' rx='10' fill='#eaf2ff'/>\\n            <g transform='translate(12,12)' fill='none' stroke='#2b6eff' stroke-opacity='0.7' stroke-width='2'>\\n              <path d='M0 20 C40 0,80 60,120 20 C160 -20,200 40,208 60' stroke-linecap='round'/>\\n              <circle cx='28' cy='32' r='6' fill='#2b6eff' stroke='none'/>\\n              <circle cx='160' cy='28' r='8' fill='#ffb86b' stroke='none'/>\\n            </g>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <section aria-labelledby='list-heading' style='margin-top:22px'>\\n        <h2 id='list-heading' style='margin:0 0 8px'>Specialty areas</h2>\\n        <div class='grid'>\\n          <div class='spec'>\\n            <h3>Anxiety & Worry</h3>\\n            <p class='muted'>Short- and mid-term work aimed at reducing overwhelm, improving sleep, and building skills to manage intrusive worry and physical tension.</p>\\n            <div class='price'>Typical pace: weekly or twice-monthly</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='spec'>\\n            <h3>Trauma-Informed Care</h3>\\n            <p class='muted'>Care that prioritizes safety and pacing. We focus on stabilization first — grounding, regulation, and sense-making — before deeper processing when you're ready.</p>\\n            <div class='price'>Starts with stabilization sessions; timeline varies</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='spec'>\\n            <h3>Relationship Patterns</h3>\\n            <p class='muted'>Work-on communication, boundaries, and repeating relationship cycles. I offer individual and partnership-focused sessions depending on needs and safety.</p>\\n            <div class='price'>Individual & couples options available</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='spec'>\\n            <h3>Life Transitions</h3>\\n            <p class='muted'>Support navigating career shifts, parenting changes, relocation, and identity transitions with practical planning and values-focused work.</p>\\n            <div class='price'>Short-term focused plans (6–12 sessions)</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='spec'>\\n            <h3>Burnout & Stress</h3>\\n            <p class='muted'>Combines workload planning, boundary setting, and stress-reduction strategies to help you manage energy and rebuild reserves.</p>\\n            <div class='price'>Flexible schedule; often combined with brief skills work</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='spec'>\\n            <h3>Mood & Self-Understanding</h3>\\n            <p class='muted'>Exploratory therapy that tracks mood, identifies triggers, and supports sustainable change in daily routines and relationships.</p>\\n            <div class='price'>Medium-term work with periodic review</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section aria-labelledby='how-heading' style='margin-top:22px'>\\n        <h2 id='how-heading'>What to expect in our first meetings</h2>\\n        <p class='muted'>Your first two sessions are an opportunity to share history, identify goals, and co-create a plan. We'll discuss confidentiality, limits to confidentiality, and the practicalities of scheduling and fees.</p>\\n        <div class='note'>I maintain clear boundaries about emergency care: I am not able to provide crisis response. If you are in immediate danger, call local emergency services or your region's crisis number.</div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section aria-labelledby='pricing-heading' style='margin-top:22px'>\\n        <h2 id='pricing-heading'>Investment & options</h2>\\n        <p class='muted'>My fee approach is straightforward: session rate, package options, and a limited sliding scale for qualifying clients. Below is a general framing; final details are discussed during intake.</p>\\n        <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap'>\\n          <div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6eefb;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;min-width:200px'>\\n            <strong>Standard session</strong>\\n            <div class='muted'>50 minutes — private pay</div>\\n            <div class='price'>$160–$200</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6eefb;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;min-width:200px'>\\n            <strong>Short check-in</strong>\\n            <div class='muted'>25 minutes — focused planning</div>\\n            <div class='price'>$95</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6eefb;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;min-width:200px'>\\n            <strong>Package</strong>\\n            <div class='muted'>6-session bundle for focused work</div>\\n            <div class='price'>$900 (save vs single session)</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section aria-labelledby='testi-heading' style='margin-top:22px'>\\n        <h2 id='testi-heading'>A few client reflections</h2>\\n        <div style='margin-top:8px' class='spec'>\\n          <div class='muted'>\\\"She helped me slow down and plan changes in small, manageable steps. It felt steady and practical.\\\"</div>\\n          <div class='small muted' style='margin-top:8px'>— Client, mid-career professional</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class='muted'>Confidentiality notice: Sessions are confidential within legal limits. I provide psychotherapy services; this is not an emergency service. If you are in crisis, call emergency services or your local crisis line immediately.</div>\\n      <div style='margin-top:8px' class='muted'>Licensed: {{LICENSE}} • Modalities: {{MODALITIES}} • Contact: <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'/>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'/>\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Approach</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#0b0f14;--panel:#0f1720;--muted:#9fb0bd;--accent:#8ef2d1;--max:1100px}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;background:var(--bg);color:#eaf7f0}\\n    .page{max-width:var(--max);margin:32px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .nav a{color:var(--muted);margin-left:16px;text-decoration:none}\\n    .hero{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,0.25),transparent);padding:22px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:20px}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:30px}\\n    .hero p{color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0}\\n    .compass{width:220px;height:220px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#081018,#0f1720);border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center}\\n    .steps{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px;flex-direction:column}\\n    .step{background:var(--panel);padding:14px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .step strong{color:var(--accent)}\\n    .sessions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .tier{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:14px;border-radius:10px}\\n    footer{margin-top:22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.hero{flex-direction:column}.sessions{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class='page'>\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class='muted' style='color:var(--muted)'>An approach grounded in clarity and care</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav class='nav'>\\n        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n        <a href='specialties.html'>Paths</a>\\n        <a href='about.html'>About</a>\\n        <a href='book.html'>Book</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <div class='hero'>\\n        <div style='flex:1'>\\n          <h1>Your therapeutic compass</h1>\\n          <p>I combine trauma-informed practices, brief evidence-informed techniques, and relational attunement. That means practical tools for regulation plus a steady, reflective relationship that helps you make sense of what you're experiencing.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='compass' aria-hidden='true'>\\n          <!-- unique hero svg for approach page -->\\n          <svg width='160' height='160' viewBox='0 0 160 160' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'>\\n            <rect width='160' height='160' rx='14' fill='#071018'/>\\n            <g transform='translate(20,20)'>\\n              <circle cx='60' cy='60' r='46' stroke='#8ef2d1' stroke-opacity='0.9' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/>\\n              <path d='M60 22 L74 60 L60 98 L46 60 Z' fill='#8ef2d1' opacity='0.9'/>\\n              <circle cx='60' cy='60' r='4' fill='#071018'/>\\n            </g>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <section aria-labelledby='method-heading' style='margin-top:18px'>\\n        <h2 id='method-heading'>Core commitments</h2>\\n        <div class='steps'>\\n          <div class='step'><strong>Safety first</strong> — We begin with grounding, predictable structure, and clear consent about what we will explore.</div>\\n          <div class='step'><strong>Collaborative pacing</strong> — You set the pace; together we decide when to focus on skills or deeper processing.</div>\\n          <div class='step'><strong>Practical outcomes</strong> — Therapy includes tools you can use between sessions alongside reflective sense-making.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section aria-labelledby='sessions-heading' style='margin-top:20px'>\\n        <h2 id='sessions-heading'>Session types & pacing</h2>\\n        <div class='sessions'>\\n          <div class='tier'>\\n            <strong>Short check-in</strong>\\n            <div class='muted'>25-minute focused session for planning and skill tuning.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class='tier'>\\n            <strong>Full session</strong>\\n            <div class='muted'>50-minute psychotherapy session for therapeutic work and processing.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class='tier'>\\n            <strong>Series work</strong>\\n            <div class='muted'>Planned 8–18 session series for deeper patterns and transitions.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section aria-labelledby='structure-heading' style='margin-top:20px'>\\n        <h2 id='structure-heading'>A typical plan — example</h2>\\n        <ol class='muted' style='line-height:1.6'>\\n          <li>Intake & assessment: Clarify goals, history, and immediate needs (1–2 sessions).</li>\\n          <li>Stabilization & skills: Build regulation and coping strategies (2–6 sessions).</li>\\n          <li>Targeted processing: Focused exploration of patterns and change work (varies).</li>\\n          <li>Maintenance & transfer: Consolidate gains and plan next steps.</li>\\n        </ol>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section aria-labelledby='pricing2-heading' style='margin-top:20px'>\\n        <h2 id='pricing2-heading'>Rates framing</h2>\\n        <p class='muted'>I aim for transparent pricing and offer a limited sliding scale. Insurance is not accepted directly; I provide superbills you can submit to your carrier when applicable.</p>\\n        <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:10px;flex-wrap:wrap'>\\n          <div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;min-width:220px'>\\n            <strong>50 min</strong>\\n            <div class='muted'>Standard session</div>\\n            <div style='font-weight:700;margin-top:6px'>$160–$200</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;min-width:220px'>\\n            <strong>Package</strong>\\n            <div class='muted'>6-session</div>\\n            <div style='font-weight:700;margin-top:6px'>$900</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section aria-labelledby='ethics-heading' style='margin-top:20px'>\\n        <h2 id='ethics-heading'>Ethical notes & boundaries</h2>\\n        <p class='muted'>I maintain confidentiality except where disclosure is required to prevent harm. I do not provide emergency services; if you are at risk of harm, please call emergency services or your local crisis line immediately. Sessions are not forensic evaluations.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section aria-labelledby='contact-heading' style='margin-top:20px'>\\n        <h2 id='contact-heading'>Ready to start?</h2>\\n        <p class='muted'>If this approach resonates, reach out for a brief consult to see if we're a good fit.</p>\\n        <a href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:#042628;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class='muted'>Contact: {{PHONE}} • <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--muted)'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      <div class='muted' style='margin-top:6px'>Licensed: {{LICENSE}} • Modalities: {{MODALITIES}}</div>\\n      <div class='muted' style='margin-top:8px;font-size:13px'>Confidentiality & scope: Therapy sessions are private within legal limits. I do not provide emergency services. If you are in crisis, call local emergency services or your region's crisis line.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
